entially complete your straight or improve your hand on the Turn. This plays cautiously to preserve your stack while retaining strong equity.\n\nReason: Checking controls the pot size and allows you to realize your hand\'s equity (drawing to a straight) without overcommitting chips against a potentially stronger range on a dangerous board.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
